cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ReactReach Baseline Evaluation: Replication Package"
abstract: >-
  Replication package for the evaluation of ReactReach, a structural
  reachability analyser for dependency vulnerabilities in React applications.
  Contains the synthetic scenario corpus, ground truth, frozen npm audit
  inputs, evaluation and performance harnesses, raw JSON and SARIF reports,
  and derived metrics.
